								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8083#msg8083"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8083#msg8083">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> May 26, 2004, 01:36:48 pm &#187;</span></td>
