	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8093"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=566" title="View the profile of Bowsinger">Bowsinger</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 20<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=566"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8093#msg8093"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8093#msg8093">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> May 27, 2004, 08:21:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Like a moth to the flame, I just gotta jump on this one.<br /><br />I don&#039;t know anyone in Ascent. I never grouped with anyone from Ascent. And I don&#039;t persay hate anyone from Ascent. But... well..... where to begin.<br /><br />Here&#039;s a guild that is always out on a limb and never has to look back or compete to any great extent when it comes to finding things to kill. It&#039;s my understanding that if your in Ascent on an Ascent raid, you STFU and do what your told when your told to do it or... your not in Ascent longer than it takes a Druid to port you out. Although this militaristic approach to EQ., may get you far and fast, you end up playing the game slightly different than oh....the other 90%.<br /><br />I doubt that Ialin will reply on this board or that he/she even knows or cares. Malagin (sp) seems to have a tight fist on the loose lips on his ship, so replying here even in kind, would be foolish and moot.<br /><br />You should probably be glad Ialin gated out, rather than bring down Murphy&#039;s Law on the whole raid. Fact is he probably had no clue what you were attempting to do, as (assuming he &quot;raids&quot; w/ ascent) his usual job isn&#039;t what you had him doing on your raid. He was also losing 10% of what is lost in /guildchat. Oh I could go on and on and make up all kinds of excuses for poor game play, the list never ends, Everexcuses.<br /><br />&quot;Coward&quot; was good, that alone should get him in here, assuming he has any merit. But why bother, since he won&#039;t be grouping with Hegemony or whatever ever again. The bridge served no purpose so burning it down makes no difference.<br /><br />I guess I&#039;ll throw it back at you and ask: Did you learn not to give non-guildies important jobs like opening their spell book.<br /><br />You might try making it a requirement that Guests disable their keyboards after typing /autofollow Serepi.<br /><br />Happy Trails <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br />Happy Trails.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 27, 2004, 08:29:45 pm by Bowsinger</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
