	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8097"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269" title="View the profile of Ssnakess">Ssnakess</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Gecko not Geico<br />
								Global Moderator<br />
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 277<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/kof1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								die plz<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.ascentguild.com" title="Ascent Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Ssnakess@mail2hell.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8097#msg8097"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8097#msg8097">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> May 28, 2004, 01:56:46 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Let&#039;s see...<br /><br />First off, Mallagin hardly plays, isn&#039;t an officer, and therefore can&#039;t boot anyone from the guild.  He&#039;s just the coolest asshole in EQ so...<br /><br />Secondly, we raid far less than say..Conviction, Fires of Time, DA/EiE...our raids last shorter periods of time.<br /><br />Do we have our fair share of lemmings? Certainly.<br /><br />Do we have more than any other guild on RN? No.<br /><br />Do you have any clue what you are talking about? Definately not.<br /><br />Oh, and a couple of small factors being overlooked....Ialin is the one who told Hegemony that FR trigger was up in the first place...<br /><br />And, of course, we haven&#039;t raided Fennin Ro in almost a year (or around that long, maybe 10 months or so?), so the chances of Ialin remembering exactly how the fight works are slim to none, and the chances of him remembering that Fennin AE rampages and casts a large range AE dot are even less.<br /><br />You can&#039;t exactly expect everyone to fully remember encounters they have not done in such a long period of time.<br /><br />Deeply sorry he fucked up on your raid, but it doesn&#039;t really matter.  You killed the mob, he didn&#039;t wipe your raid, he just made you mad.<br /><br />Oh, and we don&#039;t exactly freak out on people who can actually think on their own...I would have to say being able to think on your own makes you more efficient than any retarded lemming.<br /><br />I highly doubt anyone has ever been booted from Ascent for voicing their opinions on a matter (given that they aren&#039;t taking their opinions into an offensive manner).<br /><br />As to the whole Ialin being a coward or whatever nonsense...being a coward and knowing that this really doesn&#039;t mean anything are quite different from each other.  There is no reason for him to post here, if anywhere he could just post on our board..where exact same post was placed by Serepi.<br /><br />Even then...why would he bother?  He attends our raids and does his job well. I wont even start to give excuses for him messing up, but shit happens.<br /><br />And yes, we do play EQ different than 90% of the other players...we get more loot and have more fun than they do.<br /><br />--Edit--<br /><br />Does Bowsinger = Bowslinger? (curiousity)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
