	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8098"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=267" title="View the profile of Grem">Grem</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 392<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Officer of Fires of Time<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=267"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8098#msg8098"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8098#msg8098">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> May 28, 2004, 04:03:39 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Bowsinger, you&#039;ve never been in Ascent, you&#039;ll never be in Ascent, and you don&#039;t know shit about how Ascent works, in or out of raids. Mallagin keeping a tight ship, el oh el.&nbsp; Shut the fuck up, seriously.&nbsp; I don&#039;t assume to know the way Hegemony, or DA, or any other guild I haven&#039;t ran with do things, amazing that so many others assume they know how Ascent works.&nbsp; In one post you&#039;ve set yourself out as the biggest idiot I&#039;ve ever seen on this board.<br /><br />As for the original post.&nbsp; I know there&#039;s some reason Serepi felt it needed to be posted here, and on our webpage.&nbsp; Maybe it was Ialin truly hurt his feelings, maybe Hegemony is still on the &quot;The soon to be number 1 guild on the server!&quot; kick, maybe your t e and l buttons have been disabled.&nbsp; Whatever the reason, it comes off as a &quot;We do two expansion old stuff better than Ascent!&quot; Please...
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
