	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8099"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52" title="View the profile of Gabus">Gabus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 276<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/psychotic-day.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8099#msg8099"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8099#msg8099">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> May 28, 2004, 08:30:45 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg8098#msg8098">Quote from: Grem on May 28, 2004, 04:03:39 am</a></div><div class="quote">As for the original post.  I know there&#039;s some reason Serepi felt it needed to be posted here, and on our webpage.  Maybe it was Ialin truly hurt his feelings, maybe Hegemony is still on the &quot;The soon to be number 1 guild on the server!&quot; kick, maybe your t e and l buttons have been disabled.  Whatever the reason, it comes off as a &quot;We do two expansion old stuff better than Ascent!&quot; Please...<br /></div><br />I dont see anywhere in the original post where Hegemony makes any claim to do ANYTHING better than Ascent. I see where it says it does FR &quot;very different&quot; but not better. Thats an awful lot of paranoia to read into the original post, when Hege is NOWHERE near Ascent content, and not threatening for top spot. (whatever that is worth) In fact, if you read it, it looks like Serepi not only blames the PLAYER for poor performance, but seems surprised since that kind of play is NOT typical of people wearing an Ascent tag. Hell, thats a compliment. Decaf is your friend Grem, try to relax.<br /><br />The point of this post (and I am inferring here since I have no connection to Hege, or Ascent, and we do not travel in the same circles) seems to be:<br />1) Inform the community about a potentially disasterous raider.<br />2) Personal snipe toward the individual dumbass.<br /><br />This SHOULD be posted on Ascent&#039;s board, (or in private to officers) so those in charge of maintining the guild&#039;s image can take appropriate action/inaction. (At the discretion of the guild) If I were running a guild, and a guildmate was impacting the PR of my guild, you bet I would want to know about it. <br /><br />Strange thing about being at the top, there is a tendancy to  see threats around every corner, and behind every bush, where there are only shadows.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 28, 2004, 08:32:40 am by Gabus</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=139779" target="_blank">Gabus Magelo Profile</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
