							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yes this is Bowslinger Wongway.<br />No I don&#039;t know jack shit about Ascent.<br />Yes I raided Fear with them once, /assist heaton.<br />I didn&#039;t pull, so there was nothing to fuck up. Otherwise I&#039;m sure I would have trained them from the wrong direction.<br /><br />I may post some dumb shit, but it did get you guys to say hello. I see Sysq. up there holding his tounge. Smart move, only and idiot replies to an idiot.<br /><br />I sure miss realtime ingame debates. I say even dumber shit when I don&#039;t have time to think it over and edit. Anyway board was lacking a good argument, unfortunently, I can&#039;t make one out of this thread. Back to trolling..........
